define user ask off topic
  "can you write a poem about flowers"
  "can you bake a chocolate cake"
  "what is the recipe for pasta"
  "who is your favorite celebrity"

define bot inform off topic
  "I am SentinelRAG, specialized in analyzing and answering questions from your documents. Please ask a question related to your documents or data."

define flow handle off topic
  user ask off topic
  bot inform off topic
